reCamera port: build the Morse Micro HaLow driver (upstream release 1.14.1,
the one the vendor image shipped) against Linux 7.2.

- action frames: action_code moved into u.action, inner union anonymous
- IEEE80211_MIN_ACTION_SIZE takes the category
- timers: timer_delete[_sync], timer_container_of, hrtimer_setup
- crc7_be_byte -> crc7_be; of_get_named_gpio -> descriptor lookup
- S1G: private channel-width flags and 5.10 short-beacon semantics
  (dot11ah/s1g_compat_new.h), mainline reworked S1G
- mac80211/cfg80211 callback adapters (radio_idx, link_id, link_sta,
  wireless_dev)
- prototype/definition enum-int mismatches

